WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
This calculator separates
capacity from realized value.

00:00:03.013 --> 00:00:06.160
Adoption, eligible work and net task

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.840
savings determine the effort
equivalent that may be released.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.640
The captured share, costs and quality
allowance then affect the economic result.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.960
The default numbers are illustrative and
will change when you adjust the controls.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.480
A financial claim requires
an agreed capture mechanism.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.440
The useful discussion is which assumptions

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.000
the client can actually
measure and influence.
